CM_ BO_ 2432650495 "The GDM Control frame allows for state and speed targets to be passed to networked TCMs.";
CM_ SG_ 2432650374 Left_ControlMode "Commanded control mode for LH TCM";
CM_ BO_ 2432652543 "The System Derate PGN is intended to provide feedback to the high-level system coordinator. The information contained within details the controller’s ability to produce torque and the level to which it is derated if applicable";
CM_ BO_ 2432639487 "MowNet Faults and Misc details current and latched fault status, if present, as well as module operation time, temperature and voltage of the reporting module. All MowNet modules transmit this message";
CM_ BO_ 2432640388 "VIM General Status details assorted switch states as well as fault codes for system-level detail.";
CM_ BO_ 2432644992 "The EDM General Status frame is intended to provide status of EDM logic inputs and relay outputs. The inputs reported in this frame are the state of the physical switches.";
CM_ BO_ 2432644993 "The EDM General Status frame is intended to provide status of EDM logic inputs and relay outputs. The inputs reported in this frame are the state of the physical switches.";
CM_ BO_ 2432644226 "LBSM General Status details LBSM position, neutral state, and LBSM fault codes.";
CM_ BO_ 2432644227 "LBSM General Status details LBSM position, neutral state, and LBSM fault codes.";
CM_ BO_ 2432660618 "The DCM General Status frame is intended to provide the basic state of the DCM for high-level diagnostic and information purposes";
CM_ BO_ 2432660619 "The DCM General Status frame is intended to provide the basic state of the DCM for high-level diagnostic and information purposes";
CM_ BO_ 2164213894 "GDM General Status details the basic state of the GDM for high-level diagnostic and information.";
CM_ BO_ 2164213895 "GDM General Status details the basic state of the GDM for high-level diagnostic and information.";
CM_ BO_ 2164226192 "SSM General Status details the basic state of the SSM for high-level diagnostic and information.";
CM_ BO_ 2164226193 "SSM General Status details the basic state of the SSM for high-level diagnostic and information.";
CM_ BO_ 2432663799 "Digital Switch Control frame provides the input to the VIM to establish the state command of each appropriate High / Low function.";
CM_ SG_ 2432663799 TractionSpeedSwitch "Commanded state of the Traction Speed Switch";
CM_ SG_ 2432663799 DeckSpeedSwitch "Commanded state of the Deck Speed Switch";
CM_ BO_ 2432695592 "Digital Switch Control Heartbeat allows for application of a MowNet system power-on locking function, as well as providing a heartbeat to ensure robust communication of Digital Switch Control states.";
CM_ SG_ 2432695592 Display_Unlocked "Unlock state of display";
CM_ SG_ 2432695592 Display_Heartbeat "Display health signal";
CM_ BO_ 2499752183 "eLink is intended to allow control of a MowNet enabled vehicle over the CAN Bus.";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 Override_Left_Lapbar "Overrides left LBSM input";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 Override_Right_Lapbar "Overrides right LBSM input";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 TokResp "Token Response system for security (Not implemented)";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 Latched_Fault "Allows injection of faults into MowNet";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 inSpare "Allows override of spare input";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 inStart "Allows override of start input";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 inOpPres "Allows override of operator presence switch";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 inPTOSel "Allows override of PTO switch";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 inVirtual "Virtual switch input to MowNet";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 inHiLo "Allows override of Hi/Lo switch";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 inBrakeEn "Allows override of the brake switch";
CM_ SG_ 2499752183 inOilPress "Allows override of the oil pressure switch";
